==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{bor+|ru|cu|съкратити}}. {{surf|ru|со-|кра́ткий|-ить}}. Compare the {{cog|be|скараці́ць}} and {{cog|uk|скороти́ти}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|сократи́ть}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-сократить.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|сократи́ть|pf|impf=сокраща́ть}}

# to [[shorten]], to [[curtail]], to [[abridge]], to [[abbreviate]]
# to [[reduce]], to [[cut]], to [[curtail]], to [[retrench]]
# to [[dismiss]], to [[discharge]]; to [[lay off]]
# {{lb|ru|mathematics}} to [[cancel]], to [[abbreviate]] by [[cancellation]]

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|pf|4bщ+p|сократи́ть}}

====Related terms====
* {{l|ru|сокраще́ние}}
* {{l|ru|сокращённый}}
